    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abisirayeli banga kujya i Kanāni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iteraniro ryose ritera hejuru, rirataka, abantu iryo joro bararira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisirayeli bose bitotombera Mose na Aroni, iteraniro ryose rirababwira riti “Iyaba twaraguye mu gihugu cya Egiputa! Cyangwa iyaba twaraguye muri ubu butayu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka atujyanira iki muri icyo gihugu, kugira ngo tuhicirwe n'inkota? Abagore bacu n'abana bacu bazaba iminyago, ikiruta si uko twasubira muri Egiputa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baravugana bati “Twishyirireho umugaba dusubire muri Egiputa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Mose na Aroni bikubitira hasi bubamye, imbere y'iteraniro ry'Abisirayeli ryose ryari riteraniye aho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosuwa mwene Nuni na Kalebu mwene Yefune bari mu mubare w'abatase icyo gihugu, bashishimura imyenda yabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "babwira iteraniro ry'Abisirayeli ryose bati “Igihugu twaciyemo tugitata ni cyiza cyane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niba Uwiteka atwishimira, azatujyana muri icyo gihugu akiduhe kandi ari igihugu cy'amata n'ubuki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.3.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 3.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Icyakora ntimugomere Uwiteka kandi ntimutinye bene icyo gihugu: tuzabarya nk'imitsima, ntibagifite ikibakingira kandi Uwiteka ari mu ruhande rwacu, ntimubatinye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iteraniro ryose ritegeka ko babicisha amabuye. Maze ubwiza bw'Uwiteka bubonekera Abisirayeli bose buri mu ihema ry'ibonaniro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka ategeka ko Abisirayeli bazagwa mu butayu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka abwira Mose ati “Ubu bwoko buzageza he kunsuzugura? Buzageza he kutanyizezwa n'ibimenyetso byose nakoreye hagati muri bo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndabateza mugiga, mbakureho umwandu wabo, nkugire ubwoko bubaruta ubwinshi, bubarusha amaboko.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.11+EXO.32.12+EXO.32.13+EXO.32.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuva 32.11-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mose abwira Uwiteka ati “Abanyegiputa bazabyumva, kuko wakuje ubu bwoko muri bo amaboko yawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "babibwire bene icyo gihugu. Barumvise yuko wowe Uwiteka uri hagati muri ubu bwoko, kuko wowe Uwiteka ubonwa n'amaso, kandi igicu cyawe gihagarara hejuru yabo, ukajya imbere yabo uri mu nkingi y'igicu ku manywa, no mu nkingi y'umuriro nijoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None niwica ubu bwoko nk'umuntu umwe, amahanga yumvise inkuru yawe azavuga ati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Uwiteka yananiwe kujyana ubwo bwoko mu gihugu yarahiye ko azabuha, icyo ni cyo cyatumye abwicira mu butayu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None imbaraga z'umwami wanjye ziyerekane ko ari nyinshi nk'uko wavuze uti ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.5+EXO.20.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuva 20.5-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.6+EXO.34.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34.6-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.9+DEU.5.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guteg 5.9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.9+DEU.7.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "7.9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ‘Uwiteka atinda kurakara, afite kugira neza kwinshi, ababarira gukiranirwa n'ibicumuro, ntatsindishiriza na hato abo gutsindwa, ahōra abana gukiranirwa kwa ba se akageza ku buzukuruza n'ubuvivi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babarira gukiranirwa k'ubu bwoko nk'uko imbabazi zawe ari nyinshi, nk'uko wabubabariraga uhereye igihe baviriye mu Egiputa ukageza ubu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka aramubwira ati “Ndabababariye nk'uko unsabye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.3.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 3.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ariko ni ukuri ndahiye guhoraho kwanjye n'uko isi yose izuzura icyubahiro cy'Uwiteka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko abo bantu bose babonye icyubahiro cyanjye n'ubwiza bwanjye, n'ibimenyetso nakoreye muri Egiputa no mu butayu, bakangerageza ibi bihe uko ari icumi ntibanyumvire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ukuri ntibazabona igihugu narahiye ba sekuruza ko nzakibaha, nta n'umwe wo mu bansuzuguye uzakibona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.14.9+JOS.14.10+JOS.14.11+JOS.14.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 14.9-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " keretse umugaragu wanjye Kalebu, kuko yari afite undi mutima, agakurikira uko muyobora muri byose, nzamujyana mu gihugu yagiyemo, urubyaro rwe ruzakigira gakondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamaleki n'Abanyakanāni batuye muri kiriya gikombe, ejo muzahindukire musubire mu butayu mu nzira ijya ku Nyanja Itukura.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka abwira Mose na Aroni ati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nzageza he kwihanganira iri teraniro ribi rinyitotombera? Numvise kwitotomba kw'Abisirayeli banyitotombera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babwire uti ‘Uwiteka aravuga ati: Ndahiye guhoraho kwanjye yuko ntazabura kubagirira ibyo mwavugiye mu matwi yanjye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 3.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Intumbi zanyu zizagwa muri ubu butayu: ababazwe mwese, abamaze imyaka makumyabiri n'abayisāgije mwese mwanyitotombeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ukuri ntimuzajya mu gihugu narahirishije kumanika ukuboko yuko nzabatuzamo, keretse Kalebu mwene Yefune na Yosuwa mwene Nuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko abana banyu bato mwavuze ko bazaba iminyago, abo ni bo nzakijyanamo bamenye igihugu mwanze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko mwe, intumbi zanyu zizagwa muri ubu butayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyak 7.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi abana banyu bazamara imyaka mirongo ine baragira amatungo mu butayu, bazagendana igihano cyo kurarikira",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "kurarikira:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mu Ruheburayo ryanditswe ngo, ubusambanyi; reba Kuva 34.14-16.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kwanyu kwinshi, bageze aho imibiri yanyu izaba irimbukiye mu butayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk'uko iminsi ingana mwatatiyemo icyo gihugu uko ari mirongo ine, umunsi uzahwana n'umwaka. Ni yo muzamara muriho igihano cyo gukiranirwa kwanyu kwinshi uko imyaka ari mirongo ine, kandi muzamenya ko nabahindutse.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jyewe Uwiteka ndabivuze: sinzabura kugenza ntyo iri teraniro ribi ryose riteraniye kundwanya. Bazarimbukira muri ubu butayu, ni mo bazapfira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
